A_3 = [(), (1,2,3), (1,3,2)]
left cosets of A_3: [['()', '(1,2,3)', '(1,3,2)'], ['(1,2)', '(1,3)', '(2,3)']]
right cosets equal the left cosets (A_3 is normal): True
S_3 / A_3 has order 2 and is cyclic: True
left cosets of H = <(1,2)>: [['()', '(1,2)'], ['(1,2,3)', '(2,3)'], ['(1,3)', '(1,3,2)']]
right cosets of H: [['()', '(1,2)'], ['(1,3,2)', '(2,3)'], ['(1,2,3)', '(1,3)']]
